# Marketplace lane rate, opt-in. A carrier's pooled Marketplace rate is kept on
# every open and future load on the lane only when the carrier opts in
# (vehicle limit + valid until). 20271114173800 / 20271114174600 install the
# standing-lane trigger and lane key; 20271114201500 replaces their copy-every-
# pending-bid body with opt-in commitments. 20271116144500 seeds the lane price
# from the pooled rate; 20271117013000 makes a pooled rate a 48-hour lane
# commitment; 20271117021500 gives every bid its own 48-hour expires_at,
# refuses expired bids at award, and returns expires_at to the shipper list.
# 20271117144500 lets a carrier place a fresh bid after that clock passes.
# Apply all seven together, in order.
# Needs standing_lane_key on the target; 20271114185200 (indent-lane-index) is
# independent and may already be applied.
# Not applied anywhere. Path: V1 -> preprod -> prod.
